//! `lucene/analysis/icu` reaches statically (the `brkitr`, `coll` and
//! `translit` trees and the property, normalization and supplemental files
//! at the data root, 9,493,296 bytes in 233 files) and
//! `com/ibm/icu/ICUConfig.properties`; plus, for the whole-file closure of
//! rmp task #644 (`LocaleData`, `ULocale.getCharacterOrientation`,
//! `VersionInfo.getTZDataVersion`), every `.res` file at the data root (the
//! main locale tree with `pool.res` and `zoneinfo64.res`) and the `lang`
//! tree; plus, for the closure of rmp task #650 (`LocaleDisplayNamesImpl`'s
//! region tables, `ICUCurrencyDisplayInfoProvider`), the `region` and `curr`
//! trees: 2843 ICU data files, 19,718,928 bytes in all.
//!
//! Generated from the jar; sorted by resource name, the order
//! [`ClassLoader`](crate::jdk::ClassLoader) binary-searches.

